\newlabel{fig:family-mae}{{4}{7}{Unified architecture sketch for masked autoencoder and pure vision satellite embedding models. Satellite tiles are partially masked, encoded by a transformer-style vision backbone, and supervised through reconstruction while the latent tokens are reused as transferable embeddings}{figure.4}{}}
