\newlabel{fig:family-vision-language}{{5}{8}{Unified architecture sketch for vision-language and cross-modal satellite embeddings. The core pattern is image and text or ecological side-information encoding into a shared latent space trained by contrastive or alignment objectives}{figure.5}{}}
