\newlabel{fig:family-generalist}{{6}{9}{Unified architecture sketch for multimodal generalist EO encoders. Multiple sensor streams are tokenized, routed or aligned, fused by a shared backbone, and exported as pooled or dense representations for broad downstream transfer}{figure.6}{}}
